{"strongs": "H7690", "word": "שַׂגִּיא", "translit": "sag.gi", "root": "", "morph": "A:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "great, much", "definition": "שַׂגִּרא adjective great, much — absolute ׳ שׂ Dan 2:6 +, feminine plural שֵׂגִּיאָן Dan 2:48 ; Ezra 5:11 — \\ \\ l. great , of image Dan 2:31 (in vision), height of tree Dan 4:7 ( id. ); of honour Dan 2:6 . 2. much , fruit Dan 4:9 ; Dan 4:18 , flesh Dan 7:5 plural many , years Ezra 5:11 , gifts Dan 2:48 . 3. as adverb exceedingly , Dan 2:12 ; Dan 5:9 ; Dan 6:15 ; Dan 6:24 ; Dan 7:28 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9913')\">BDB9913</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7690')\">H7690</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9912')\">BDB9912</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9914')\">BDB9914</entry></div><p> <bdbarc>שַׂגִּרא</bdbarc> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>great, much</highlightword> — absolute <bdbarc>׳</bdbarc><bdbarc>שׂ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,6)\">Dan 2:6</ref> +, feminine plural <bdbarc>שֵׂגִּיאָן</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 2:48\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,48)\">Dan 2:48</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:11\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,11)\">Ezra 5:11</ref> — <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>l.</b> <highlight>great</highlight>, of image <ref ref=\"Dan 2:31\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,31)\">Dan 2:31</ref> (in vision), height of tree <ref ref=\"Dan 4:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,7)\">Dan 4:7</ref> (<highlight>id.</highlight>); of honour <ref ref=\"Dan 2:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,6)\">Dan 2:6</ref>. <div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>much</highlight>, fruit <ref ref=\"Dan 4:9\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEn